Feature: Pay for a hold and turn it into an order
  Only the buyer of an ACTIVE hold checks it out, at or before its expiry time, with an approved payment.
  The order has one ticket per held seat or standing place, and its total is the line prices plus the fees.

  Scenario Outline: A paid checkout gives the order, in the currency of the hold, with OrderPlaced and a TicketIssued per ticket
    When I run "check_out" with:
      | idempotency_key | hold_id                              | payment_reference | payment_outcome | caller                                       | called_at            | stored_hold   |
      | checkout-key-1  | 3b8e7a10-2c4d-4e6f-9a1b-2c3d4e5f6a7b | pay-123           | approved        | {"caller_id": "ada", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-01T19:05:00Z | <stored_hold> |
    Then the output is "placed_order":
      | converted_hold                                                                  | order_placed                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           | tickets_issued                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
