  Scenario Outline: A checkout request that breaks a rule is rejected
    When I run "check_out" with:
      | idempotency_key | hold_id   | payment_reference   | payment_outcome | caller                                       | called_at            | stored_hold                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
      | checkout-key-1  | <hold_id> | <payment_reference> | <outcome>       | {"caller_id": "ada", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-01T19:05:00Z | {"hold_id": "3b8e7a10-2c4d-4e6f-9a1b-2c3d4e5f6a7b", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "buyer_id": "ada", "hold_status": "ACTIVE", "held_lines": [{"place_kind": "seated", "section": "A1", "row": "C", "seat_number": 12, "quantity": 1, "price": {"amount_minor": 5000, "currency": "USD"}}, {"place_kind": "standing", "section": "FLOOR", "quantity": 2, "price": {"amount_minor": 6000, "currency": "USD"}}], "total": {"amount_minor": 11000, "currency": "USD"}, "created_at": "2026-12-01T19:00:00Z", "expires_at": "2026-12-01T19:10:00Z"} |
